<title>USA: Puroflow pays lender, recievership ends.</title>
<headline>Puroflow pays lender, recievership ends.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Puroflow Inc said Friday it had paid all debt owed to its secured lender Imperial Bank, and obtained a discharge of the receivership the bank had placed on Puroflow in May.</p>
<p>Puroflow said it will take a one-time charge of $89,834 in its third quarter ending October 31, to account for the payment to Imperial bank.</p>
<p>Because it is no longer in receivership, the company will be able to reduce operating costs by roughly $40,000 per month starting September 1, it said.</p>
